    "show_share": true,
    "description": "October 2025 was an exceptionally productive and successful month for AKU's Arusha Climate and Environmental Research Centre (AKU-ACER). The Centre cemented its role as a regional leader in climate and health research by co-hosting a major scientific conference and launching an inaugural international symposium. AKU-ACER's researchers also showcased their expertise globally through key workshops and published high-impact journal articles.",
